What is the tightest Big-O time complexity of the following code?
```c
for (i = 1; i <= n; i = i * 3)
    count++;
```

How many times is count++ executed when n = 20?
```c
for (i = 1; i <= n; i++)
    for (j = 1; j <= i; j++)
        count++;
```

What is the tightest Big-O time complexity of the following code?
```c
for (i = n; i > 0; i = i / 2)
    for (j = 0; j < i; j++)
        count++;
```

